s8-3-p18 = prose (cons "The same pattern applies to source syntax. A C++ declaration may have one representation as source tokens, another as a typed abstract syntax tree, another as an interpreter closure, and another as a target-machine artifact. The relevant relations are not automatically equivalences: parsing can discard comments; optimization can preserve observations without preserving instruction traces; compiling a source with unspecified behavior may select one permitted behavior. Precision consists in stating which relation actually holds." nil)
